#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Batteries replaced too often: {first} d then {second} d (under 30 d)"
msgstr ""
"Piles remplacées trop souvent : {first} j puis {second} j (moins de 30 j)"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
msgid ""
"Check the declared chemistry ([battery] chemistry), try fresh cells of "
"another batch or low self-discharge NiMH cells, and switch the keyboard off "
"when it is not used."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez la chimie déclarée ([battery] chemistry), essayez des piles neuves "
"d'un autre lot ou des piles NiMH à faible autodécharge, et éteignez le "
"clavier quand il ne sert pas."

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/alias.rs
