msgid ""
"\n"
"RE-PAIRING ({why}).\n"
"This REMOVES the pairing of “{name}” on this computer, then starts the "
"pairing assistant.\n"
"The keyboard will not work until pairing is done: keep another input device "
"at hand.\n"
"Type {CONFIRM} then Enter to go on, or just Enter to cancel: "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"RÉ-APPAIRAGE ({why}).\n"
"Cela SUPPRIME le pairage de « {name} » sur cet ordinateur puis lance "
"l'assistant d'appairage.\n"
"Le clavier ne fonctionnera plus jusqu'à la fin de l'appairage : gardez une "
"autre saisie à portée.\n"
"Tapez {CONFIRM} puis Entrée pour continuer, ou seulement Entrée pour "
"annuler : "

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "refused: interactive confirmation required (stdin is not a terminal)."
msgstr ""
"refusé : confirmation interactive obligatoire (stdin n'est pas un terminal)."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "  pairing removed."
msgstr "  pairage supprimé."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "  pairing not removed (RemoveDevice: {e})"
msgstr "  appairage non supprimé (RemoveDevice : {e})"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"→ Switch the keyboard off (power button, 3 s) and on again: its light blinks "
"(pairing mode).\n"
"→ In the assistant, pick the keyboard, type the displayed code ON THE "
"KEYBOARD, then Enter."
msgstr ""
"→ Éteignez le clavier (bouton d'alimentation, 3 s), rallumez-le : le voyant "
"clignote (mode appairage).\n"
"→ Dans l'assistant, choisissez le clavier, tapez sur le CLAVIER le code "
"affiché puis Entrée."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"  No graphical assistant: `bluetoothctl`, then `scan on`, `pair <MAC>`, type "
"the code on the keyboard, `trust <MAC>`, `connect <MAC>`."
msgstr ""
"  Aucun assistant graphique : `bluetoothctl`, puis `scan on`, `pair <MAC>`, "
"code tapé sur le clavier, `trust <MAC>`, `connect <MAC>`."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "  (waiting for the assistant…)"
msgstr "  (attente de l'appairage dans l'assistant…)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "✓ Keyboard re-paired, connected and trusted."
msgstr "✓ Clavier ré-appairé, connecté et approuvé."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"✗ No paired + connected keyboard after 4 min. Run `akmctl repair` again."
msgstr ""
"✗ Pas de clavier appairé + connecté après 4 min. Relancez `akmctl repair`."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"\n"
"CLEAN FORGET, like macOS: the keyboard is connected, the computer first "
"sends it “RecantConnection”\n"
"(SET Feature 0x41, one byte, wire 53 41), waits 2 s for the link to drop, "
"then ONLY removes the pairing.\n"
"The exact effect of 0x41 on the keyboard was never measured (simple drop or "
"forgetting this computer).\n"
"Then, to re-pair: switch the keyboard off (3 s) and on (blinking light = "
"pairing mode),\n"
"pick it in the assistant and type the displayed code ON THE KEYBOARD, then "
"Enter."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"OUBLI PROPRE, comme macOS : le clavier est connecté, l'ordinateur lui envoie "
"d'abord « RecantConnection »\n"
"(SET Feature 0x41, un octet, fil 53 41), attend 2 s que la liaison tombe, "
"puis SEULEMENT supprime le pairage.\n"
"L'effet exact de 0x41 sur le clavier n'a jamais été mesuré (simple coupure "
"ou oubli de cet ordinateur).\n"
"Ensuite, pour ré-appairer : éteignez le clavier (3 s), rallumez-le (le "
"voyant clignote = mode appairage),\n"
"choisissez-le dans l'assistant et tapez le code affiché SUR LE CLAVIER puis "
"Entrée."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "  pairing removed (link dropped: {}), backup: {}"
msgstr "  pairage supprimé (liaison tombée : {}), sauvegarde : {}"

